# Dashboard (Vite + React 19 + Tailwind 4)

- API calls through `dashboard/src/api/client.ts` and `VITE_API_URL`.
- Functional components, TypeScript strict — no `any` without reason.
- Keep UI changes minimal; match existing component patterns in `dashboard/src/`.
- Lint: `npm run lint` from `dashboard/`.
